{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（17日）上午11時06分，警方接獲多人報案，指完善路近大發街交界一輛貨櫃車翻側，司機被困。救援人員到場將司機救出，司機接受簡單治理後毋須送院。網上圖片可見，貨櫃車擱在路中花槽石壆山，車內的貨物及雜物等散落一地，交通警員在場協助。</p><p>現場消息指，一輛貨櫃車沿完善路九龍方向行駛，駛至大發街燈口時，懷疑失控向右翻側，並擱在路中花槽石壆。司機受輕傷毋須送院。事發後有兩部大型吊雞車到場將肇事貨櫃車拖走。</p><figure><img alt=\"貨櫃車翻側。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166008062427795456317590.jpeg/EhhO1QHIl3l0STQBbNyhgxjyG_zQAhdNfB882VkfPNk\"/><figcaption>貨櫃車翻側。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車翻側。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166007235810168832438562.jpeg/L2dFQ32Tv3OEODr_XG8lEsAMU6mieB87f8jfPlrI3z4\"/><figcaption>貨車翻側。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車翻側。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166007238863753216953610.jpeg/kWPbLsOQSVpYE2Dnx3L49QssSb-lxu_x6vqGJs_6hiY\"/><figcaption>貨車翻側。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車翻側。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166007241858617344927013.jpeg/uYDYACpl5BFPwqHDFqNUWM88MPZgPEqgSlSWjG9Ulow\"/><figcaption>貨車翻側。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"吊雞車正設法拖走車輛。（馬耀文攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1166007245126111232894621.jpeg/COMuoJWhglocS9v7Qv6wbLecmCz7Dc0VC9IUzS7SFM0\"/><figcaption>吊雞車正設法拖走車輛。（馬耀文攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車剷上路中花槽石壆後翻側。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165990201970266112856473.jpeg/ED1SlpeamSAP5EjHdXfEhYtyaJykQYMx8BRJCPAUSQg\"/><figcaption>貨車剷上路中花槽石壆後翻側。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"車內的貨物及雜物等散落一地。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165990199596158976893067.jpeg/Wmx5MMebmAhboKDXY_f_M-ku3E7fZSZ56oKdHeqCnR0\"/><figcaption>車內的貨物及雜物等散落一地。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貨車剷上路中花槽石壆後翻側。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165990197159137280635210.jpeg/w2GzGgCJ6I401MTxYEg2a7Ar3sNZXsNPdwpa7ncKWu4\"/><figcaption>貨車剷上路中花槽石壆後翻側。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"交通警員在場協助。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260817/1165990194818584576289076.jpeg/CJD3KWOIhubsw117ZQBNL0SFxtro6zKWdgDRc3YA0XM\"/><figcaption>交通警員在場協助。（馬路的事 (即時交通資訊台)/Tody Ko 圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-17T05:19:47.940046+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":430,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}